seconds, allowing you to attack without losing energy. It's up to you to make the most of this new mechanic to lead your rider to the victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/40c64c1b606e9a73d46d037f76fd4b77.webp?t=1769696560\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/73800a7d89a1bef7af8074698422ec4c.poster.avif?t=1769696560\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/73800a7d89a1bef7af8074698422ec4c.webm?t=1769696560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/73800a7d89a1bef7af8074698422ec4c.mp4?t=1769696560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out to conquer new cycling races in Tour de France 2025. Discover the Flèche Wallonne, the iconic race of the Ardennes triptych, with its mythical finish at the top of the Mur de Huy. Take part in the original Circuit Grand Est race and discover the stages that make it up. Each race offers the opportunity to forge a little more of your legend and strengthen your reputation as a cyclist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/20d7cc4edbefeae93754cce7cf621645.webp?t=1769696560\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin